# Scripted input for programs/conform (README "Conformance image").
# conform.c checks these exact events (ev_want, t_pads), so keep the two in
# step.

# Frames 2-5: one of each kind of input event; the program reads the queue
# at frame 6 and compares it with ev_want.
2 down a shift ctrl
2 up a
2 press enter alt meta
3 text aé你😀
3 pointer 639 479 7
3 pointer 0 0 0
4 click 320 240
4 wheel -3 2
4 wheel 127 -127
5 feeds-updated
5 feeds-updated   # a second one in the same frame is dropped (SPEC 5)
5 down f12 meta
5 up 0xE7

# Frame 8: 70 text events; the queue holds 64 (SPEC 5), read at frame 9.
8 text 0123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789

# Controllers (SPEC 6), read at frames 9 (none), 10, 11, 12 and 13.
10 pad 0 2013 -127 127 5 -5
10 pad 2 ffff 0 0
12 pad 0 1 0 0
13 pad 0 off
13 pad 2 off
